8.4 Test queued follow-ups with Combat Assist

A queued Attack 2 may begin from a position where Attack 1 has pushed the opponent away.

That is acceptable.

The queued move should go through the normal Combat Assist pathway.

If the follow-up needs a legal short approach, perform it.

If the opponent is too far away, the action may miss naturally.

