13.7 Frame-rate independence

The simulation is fixed-step.

Verify that the same deterministic input sequence produces the same gameplay outcome under different rendering frame rates.

Do not use wall-clock timers, setTimeout(), or animation-frame callbacks to decide when queued attacks execute.

Use simulation state and fixed-step timing.

